---
description: Repository rules for agents
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before doing anything and follow it.
Your harness is `cursor`. A lead follows its playbook, the skill
`lead-<maintainer>`; a subagent follows its role, the skill `role-<role>`
(both under `.agents/skills/`), and starts with the
`go tool gate agent new` command written there, then works only inside the
worktree it prints.
